[en.DECISION_C02_APPLY_FROM_EMPIRE]
Apply logs From Empire

[en.DECISION_C02_APPLY_FROM_EMPIRE_desc]
The only source of large amounts of wood is the Empire. But Empire’s logs never came without strings attached... and the strings are there for safety reasons, during transport, I guess?

[zh.DECISION_C02_APPLY_FROM_EMPIRE]
向帝国申请木材

[zh.DECISION_C02_APPLY_FROM_EMPIRE_desc]
能够大量获取木材的唯一途径是向帝国申请。但是帝国的木材从来都不是无条件的... 为了安全起见，运输过程中会有一些条件，大概？
